\item OpenAI, \emph{Boundedness and persistence of weakly reversible mass-action systems}, 2026-09-25; citation key \texttt{OAI:Boundedness-and-persistence-of-weakly-reversible-mass-action-systems-September-25-2026}. \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Boundedness-and-persistence-of-weakly-reversible-mass-action-systems-September-25-2026/paper.pdf}{PDF (GitHub)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/raw/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Boundedness-and-persistence-of-weakly-reversible-mass-action-systems-September-25-2026/paper.pdf}{PDF (direct)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Boundedness-and-persistence-of-weakly-reversible-mass-action-systems-September-25-2026/README.md}{Manuscript page and citation}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/main/preprints/Boundedness-and-persistence-of-weakly-reversible-mass-action-systems-September-25-2026/paper.pdf}{Latest version}; Statement source: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Boundedness-and-persistence-of-weakly-reversible-mass-action-systems-September-25-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex\#L40}{thm:main}; Statement source: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Boundedness-and-persistence-of-weakly-reversible-mass-action-systems-September-25-2026/build/sections/03-dynamics.tex\#L437}{rem:complex-balanced-convergence}.
